# This repo is cloned with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites checked-out files
# to CRLF. widget/src/generated/tokens.ts is asserted byte-for-byte against a
# fresh generator run by widget/src/generated/tokens.drift.test.ts, so a CRLF
# rewrite would fail that test on every Windows clone with a whitespace-only
# diff that reads like a real token change. Pin line endings to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
